  "title": "Understanding Ambient AI Scribes and How They Fit into Your Practice",
  "summary": "This blog explains how **ambient AI scribes** streamline clinical workflows by automatically converting patient-provider conversations into structured, EHR-ready notes—saving up to 18 minutes per visit. It offers a practical, phased approach to integration, emphasizing minimal disruption, compatibility with major EHRs, and measurable efficiency gains. By reducing administrative burden and improving documentation quality, ambient AI scribes help practices boost productivity, reduce burnout, and enhance patient care in 2025.",
